  "content_html": "<p>For the past couple of weeks, you could get my latest book &#8212; <em><a href=\"https://lcamtuf.coredump.cx/electronics/\">The Secret Life of Circuits</a></em> &#8212; directly from the publisher. That said, I know that some of you don&#8217;t want Jeff Bezos to starve, so I&#8217;m happy to announce that it&#8217;s now in stock on Amazon:</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/dp/1718504802&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Buy on Amazon&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/1718504802\"><span>Buy on Amazon</span></a></p><p>Prospective readers in Europe can place orders on <em><a href=\"https://amazon.de/dp/1718504802\">amazon.de</a>, <a href=\"https://amazon.fr/dp/1718504802\">amazon.fr</a>, <a href=\"https://amazon.pl/dp/1718504802\">amazon.pl</a>, <a href=\"https://amazon.es/dp/1718504802\">amazon.es</a>, <a href=\"https://amazon.nl/dp/1718504802\">amazon.nl</a>, <a href=\"https://amazon.se/dp/1718504802\">amazon.se</a>, <a href=\"https://amazon.it/dp/1718504802\">amazon.it</a>,</em> and <em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/1718504802\">amazon.co.uk</a>. </em>The book is also available from <a href=\"https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/the-secret-life-of-circuits-michal-zalewski/1149922689?ean=9781718504806\">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> and other major online retailers in the US and Canada.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i_7m!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99878b41-a047-45fc-8a3a-54cdc25e50f0_2000x1334.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i_7m!,w_424