kcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i_7m!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99878b41-a047-45fc-8a3a-54cdc25e50f0_2000x1334.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i_7m!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99878b41-a047-45fc-8a3a-54cdc25e50f0_2000x1334.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i_7m!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99878b41-a047-45fc-8a3a-54cdc25e50f0_2000x1334.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i_7m!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99878b41-a047-45fc-8a3a-54cdc25e50f0_2000x1334.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\"><em>We conducted rigorous tests to confirm the book is free of AI slop.</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>While I have you here, a small plea: if you read <em>The Secret Life of Circuits </em>and have an Amazon account, please consider leaving an honest review. Reviews matter for their recommendation algorithm, and in 2026, every human author is &#8220;competing&#8221; with <a href=\"https://blog.coredump.cx/p/the-100000-whys-of-ai\">hundreds of AI-generated books</a>. There&#8217;s even AI title-squatting going on:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_bla